      "description": "A powerful Stylized Cable Reel, inspired by the robust and functional aesthetics of North African utility and construction. Its distressed wooden planks, held together with visible, rustic bolts, showcase a rich tapestry of weathered textures and dark stains, reflecting the harsh yet beautiful environments of the Maghreb. The pronounced wood grain and practical design embody the enduring character of well-used equipment, seamlessly blending into stylized desert towns or industrial zones. Crafted with AI and optimized for real-time use, this Tier I asset is ideal for Game environments. Perfect for stylized exteriors, infrastructure nodes, or lore-rich overlays. Shared freely to empower creators and celebrate open-access artistry.",
